items=[p('TECHNICAL REPORT / 01',small),p('Hybrid Algorithm-Based 3D Container Loading Optimisation',title),p('Ahlad Modi / Final technical report',small),p('Main five-trial comparison',head),p('The hybrid-minus-enhanced-First-Fit difference was +0.48 percentage points (paired 95% interval -0.32 to +1.26). The interval includes zero, so an overall improvement is not established.'),table([['Method','Mean util.','Best util.','Boxes','Volume (L)','Mean s','Max s','Violations'],['Enhanced FF','69.15%','70.09%','10.31','663.82','0.12644','0.16234','0'],['Hybrid','69.63%','70.55%','10.15','668.45','0.15471','0.20023','0']],[77,59,55,41,65,63,63,76]),p('Enhanced FF means weight-aware multi-start First-Fit. Each method ran five trials per case on 30 cases. Best utilization averages each case\'s best trial. Count, volume and elapsed time average all 150 trials per method. Violations total all returned packings.',small),p('Deterministic reference required by the brief',head),table([['Method / source','Utilization','Boxes','Volume (L)','Mean s','Violations'],['Single-pass FFD / earlier run','65.79%','9.13','631.60','0.001899','0']],[155,70,50,75,73,76]),p('This reference uses the same 30 inputs, with one deterministic pass per case. Its timings come from the earlier recorded run and are not contemporaneous with the five-trial comparison. Source: results/main_v4/deterministic_reference.csv.',small),p('Scoring cutoff and elapsed time',head),p('The 0.15 s cutoff governs which validated results count. An attempt already underway can finish later, but its result is discarded. Elapsed time includes that work. Timing includes construction, search, repair and validation.'),p('Scope of the evidence',head),p('These cases were reused while improving the algorithms. This is an exploratory comparison on development cases, not a fresh held-out test. Five repeats improve repeatability but do not establish generalization. The mixed-family gain motivates a new test with settings fixed in advance.'),p('Primary evidence: results/main_v4/summary.csv, intervals.csv and packings.json. Run python main_comparison.py --output reproduced/main_v4.',small)]
first=page(items,1)
items=[p('TECHNICAL REPORT / 02',small),p('Model and experiment definitions',title),p('Inputs and feasibility',head),p('Thirty cases use a 1200 x 1000 x 800 mm container (960 L), with ten cases per family and 10, 15 or 20 boxes. Geometry cases split a grid into a known full tiling. Payload cases use 200-400 mm box edges and a 45% weight allowance. Mixed cases use 300-600 mm edges, 105-165% offered volume and a 72% weight allowance. docs/model.md gives distributions, rotation probabilities and seeds. The brief\'s larger suggested container remains in the original datasets.'),p('Coordinates are integer mm and weights integer grams. Each box appears at most once, uses a permitted orientation, lies inside the container and does not overlap. Touching faces is allowed. Total weight must fit. Full support is optional and is disabled in the main comparison.'),p('Expanded QUBO',head),p('Candidate i fixes a package, position and orientation. Binary x<sub>i</sub> selects it; v<sub>i</sub> is its volume. C contains unordered overlapping or same-package pairs, counted once. Omission is allowed.'),p('E(x,y) = -&#8721;<sub>i</sub> v<sub>i</sub>x<sub>i</sub> + &#955;&#8721;<sub>(i,j) in C</sub> x<sub>i</sub>x<sub>j</sub><br/> + &#956;(&#8721;<sub>i</sub> a<sub>i</sub>x<sub>i</sub> + &#8721;<sub>k</sub> 2<super>k</super>y<sub>k</sub> - B)<super>2</super>'),p('Let g be the GCD of weights and capacity (or 1 if all are zero). Exact weight ticks are a<sub>i</sub> = weight<sub>i</sub>/g and B = capacity/g. Binary slack y uses B.bit_length() bits. The main run sets &#955; = &#956; = max(v<sub>i</sub>) + 1. Conflicts penalize duplicate assignments and overlaps. The shared classical validator is the authority on feasibility.'),p('Production search and repair',head),p('The compound annealer visits conflict-free states and minimizes slack analytically. Its reduced energy is -&#8721; v<sub>i</sub>x<sub>i</sub> + &#956; max(0, &#8721; a<sub>i</sub>x<sub>i</sub> - B)<super>2</super>. It does not sample all expanded binary variables. The independent neal check samples the expanded QUBO. Each main attempt combines varied-corner layouts up to 160 candidates, uses 45 sweeps and four reads, then strict descent. Repair resolves geometry conflicts and optimizes payload over retained placements.'),p('Baselines and inference',head),p('Deterministic FFD sorts by volume then ID. Enhanced FF adds longest-edge, volume-per-gram and knapsack-guided orders, then shuffled restarts. Main trial seeds are 301-305. The paired bootstrap resamples case means (5000 draws, seed 9503). HiGHS certifies fixed-pool optima only. The next pages retain historical supporting experiments.',small)]
second=page(items,2)
items=[p('TECHNICAL REPORT / 06',small),p('Reproduction and next steps',title),p('Evidence and provenance',head),p('The README gives environment setup and commands. The main five-trial evidence is in results/main_v4. Full inputs accompany its saved packings. The original main run did not record environment versions; its environment field is explicitly unknown. Future runs record Python, platform, package versions and source hashes, plus a deterministic reference.'),p('Run python main_comparison.py --output reproduced/main_v4. Timed scores can change with machine load. Run python -m unittest discover -s tests -v for checks. The original saved scores and timings were preserved during the documentation review.',small),p('Historical supporting experiments',head),p('effort_benchmark.py --followup reproduces the three-trial sweep; --fixed-only selects attempt-capped scores. explicit_qubo.py --tune runs the separate neal penalty grid. Supporting CSVs are in results/effort_v4. The historical demo layouts come from results/heldout/heldout.json, not the main v4 trials.'),p('Hardware and limitations',head),p('Recorded ibm_fez fixtures decoded H0 correctly on 1013/1024 shots. H1-H3 raw optimum hit rates were 31.00%, 24.96% and 1.54%. These small workflow checks are separate from the classical comparison and establish no quantum advantage. Hardware is optional. Support contact area does not certify load-bearing strength, stability or cargo securing.'),p('Next experiment',head),p('Hold algorithm settings fixed and evaluate new mixed and geometry cases. Measure pool optima to distinguish missing placements from search losses. Treat the current intervals as exploratory because the cases informed development.'),Image(str(ROOT/'docs/figures/packing_4302.png'),width=300,height=207),p('Historical mixed case 4302, trial seed 301 from the earlier three-trial run. First-Fit is at left, hybrid at right. The slice shows free area in pale blue.',small),p('Assignment: optimisation_project_brief.pdf, sections 5-7. Model details: docs/model.md. Deterministic reference: docs/deterministic_reference.md. Current main evidence: results/main_v4/summary.csv and intervals.csv.',small)]
last=page(items,6)
w=PdfWriter();w.add_page(first);w.add_page(second)
for pg in PdfReader(source).pages:w.add_page(pg)
